	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8FB8D8 to=#E2F2FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>没有以太矿脉</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>以太矿石只会出现在</grad><grad from=#8FD6FF to=#4FA8E8 f=0.8>末地城市的宝箱中，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个宝箱有</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1到2个。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一套完整的盔甲和全套工具会消耗大量塔楼。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#8FB8D8 to=#E2F2FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>何必费心</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿戴盔甲时完全隐形，这或许是它最好或最糟糕的一点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>工具在 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3x3</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 区域内挖掘，按住 Shift 可关闭此功能以获取单个方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>套装加成是真正的护盾，可不是小加成哦。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 每种以太工具都需要在锭的上方放置两根末地棒，所以先制作它们可以省一次往返。"
			]
			icon: "enigmaticlegacy:etherium_ingot"
			id: "18A26E53B576F0DC"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#8FB8D8 to=#8FB8D8>回报丰厚的末地城市之旅。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1FEC3BEC860BF338"
				title: "以太的问题已经理解了"
